We have found our Alphas are very stable to 4 GB RAM.
CS20 is only for those who insist on 1U. Frankly I find that form factor 
very limiting.
It is all the rage nowadays, but I think the price of lack of space, slots, 
drive bays, and cooling issues does not make much sense.
Drives up costs quickly too.

The current UP2000+ is the same chipset, and we provide those in a 3U with 
full expansion capabilities at a more reasonable price.


