@@ -1,3 +1,12 @@=0A=
+2000-12-27  Soohoon Lee  <soohoon.lee@api-networks.com>=0A=
+	* network boot with initrd support.=0A=
+	To make things easy(no recompile etc.) there's netabootwrap.=0A=
+	It'll merge net_aboot, kernel and initrd images and build=0A=
+	network bootable image. net_aboot.nh will not be usable=0A=
+	but netabootwrap has all the functions.=0A=
+	Without options, It'll look for vmlinux.gz and build=0A=
+	netboot.img, it's net_aboot + vmlinux.gz.=0A=
+=0A=
 2000-06-27  David Huggins-Daines  <dhd@linuxcare.com>=0A=
 =0A=
 	* README: Removed the doc/ subdirectory, since it was out of sync=0A=
